Roland Zeta Regio posted: It is finally live! =F0=9F=9A=80

After weeks of late-night coding, debugging, and designing, I am thrilled t=
o officially launch my personal portfolio, a space that goes beyond just li=
sting my tech stack and truly tells the story of my journey in tech.

Inside, you will walk through my actual experiences, including:
1. My Academic Roots: My growth and continuous learning as an IT student at=
 PUP-STC.
2. Key Milestones: Leading our Capstone mobile game (LANDAS) and taking the=
 mic to pitch innovative ideas to the market.
3. Enterprise Impact: The real-world systems I engineered to digitize facto=
ry workflows during my OJT at Arktech Philippines.
4. Interactive Features: The site itself is an experience, complete with dy=
namic CSS themes, a custom "Meowtivator" chat widget, a simple music player=
 of my song choice and a built-in quiz.

To build this platform, I intentionally engineered the architecture from th=
e ground up using pure HTML5, CSS3, Bootstrap, and Vanilla JavaScript. I ch=
ose this specific stack to showcase my absolute grasp of core web fundament=
als and industry best practices. By driving the platform through strict JSO=
N schemas and dynamically injecting every component into the DOM, I wanted =
to demonstrate a deep focus on:
- Application speed & structural efficiency
- Seamless data flow & dynamic approaches
- Interactiveness & purposeful UI/UX design

What I am looking for next:
Right now, I am actively open to new opportunities=E2=80=94especially proje=
ct-based offers, freelance collaborations, or contract roles=E2=80=94that a=
lign with my core strengths:
- Full-Stack Web Development
- IT Project Management
- Quality Assurance & System Optimization

While web development and QA are my strongest suits, I have a massive appet=
ite for continuous learning and am incredibly eager to take on projects tha=
t allow me to dive even deeper into mobile and broader software development=
 so, If you have a project in mind, or if your team is looking for a driven=
, adaptable IT professional who loves turning those ideas into streamlined =
solutions, I would love to connect. =F0=9F=A4=9D

